  (text "OE_N pull-up blanks panel during reset; other signals default low.\nAHCT inputs accept Pico 3.3 V high levels and produce 5 V outputs.\nKeep ribbon cable short (start <=30 cm); 33-ohm resistors damp edges.\nPin8 is GND here; some panels use it as address E. Verify actual model."
